sequenceDiagram
  participant Parent as Parent Loop
  participant TaskTool as TaskTool
  participant Child as Child Session (subagent)
  Parent->>MessageV2: detect subtask parts (LIFO)
  Parent->>Parent: batch up to N subtasks
  loop for each subtask in batch
    Parent->>Session: create assistant message
    Parent->>Session: create tool part (status=running)
  end
  par parallel execute
    loop each subtask
      Parent->>TaskTool: execute(taskArgs, ctx)
      TaskTool->>Child: SessionPrompt.prompt(childSession)
      Child-->>TaskTool: return result
      TaskTool-->>Parent: return result
    end
  and
  end
  Parent->>Parent: serial write-back (update messages & parts)
  Parent->>Session: update message.finish, update part.status
  Parent->>Session: optionally insert synthetic user messages
  Parent->>Loop: continue

